# n8n Educational Workflow Guidelines
# IMPORTANT: Workflows are designed for n8n version 2.8.3 and above ONLY

1. Use Manual Trigger and Edit Fields to mock data.
2. Clear naming and notes for each node.
3. Focus on specific flow control per file (IF/Switch, Loop, Merge).

# Version Compatibility
- Minimum n8n version: 2.8.3
- Recommended: Latest stable version
- Tested on: n8n 2.8.3 (Docker Desktop)
